# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# NOTE: the bot user-agent split for /listing/:id OG cards has no _redirects
# equivalent and no Pages Function replacement (Functions removed 1 Nov 2026
# after a bot crawl burned the Workers quota): /listing/:id serves the SPA
# shell statically below, bots and humans alike, no Function runs.
# NOTE: /api/v1/* has no proxy rule here — the frontend calls the HF API
# directly (VITE_API_URL). Do not re-add a proxy rule or a Function for it.
/assets/* /assets/:splat 200
/snapshots/* /snapshots/:splat 200
# SPA routes with no prerendered shell.
# Static routes (/calculator, /trends, /cars/:make, /cars/:make/:model, ...) are
# served from the route shells scripts/prerender-seo.mjs writes, so they need
# no rule. Do NOT add a catch-all "/* /index.html 200": Pages rejects it as an
# infinite loop (it strips .html / index) and ignores it, and _redirects rules
# win over static assets, so any broader rule would shadow the shells. Unknown
# URLs fall through to the static 404.html with a real 404.
# Retired paths: real 301s (raw HTML used to be the indexable home shell).
/leasing /finance 301
/admin /motormila/admin 301
/price-index /trends 301
/valuation /estimate 301
# Common typed paths (nav labels, old habits): real 301s to the page they mean.
/prices /trends 301
/price /trends 301
/tools /calculator 301
/calculators /calculator 301
/tax-calculator /calculator 301
/import-calculator /calculator 301
/value /estimate 301
/saved /alerts 301
/watchlist /alerts 301
/sell-my-car /sell 301
/plans /pricing 301
/deals /best-picks 301
/app /mobile-app 301
/login /sign-in 301
/signin /sign-in 301
/signup /sign-up 301
/cars/:make/:model/:year / 200
/locations/:district / 200
/compare/:slug / 200
# /listing/:id was a Pages Function (bot OG split) until 31 Oct 2026 — removed because a bot crawl of 107k listing URLs burned the 100k/day Workers quota. Serve the SPA shell statically instead; bots and humans both get index.html, no Function runs.
/listing/:id / 200
/official-pulse/* / 200
# Nested admin pages use the SPA; keep the prerendered admin root shell.
/motormila/admin/* / 200

# 1 Nov 2026: ALL Pages Functions removed (Workers daily quota) — /cars/* now serves the SPA shell statically, like /listing/:id and /compare/:slug.
/cars/:make / 200
/cars/:make/:model / 200
